{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Long ago, people traded goods without using money.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.37,0.79],[0.84,1.18],[1.23,1.64],[1.71,2.04],[2.1,2.48],[2.57,2.93],[3.01,3.71]]},{"text":"This kind of trading was called barter.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.35,0.56],[0.61,0.69],[0.76,1.15],[1.22,1.37],[1.45,1.74],[1.79,2.65]]},{"text":"Barter worked, but it was sometimes difficult to agree on value.","words":[[0,0.51],[0.58,1.13],[1.37,1.54],[1.59,1.68],[1.75,1.92],[2.01,2.66],[2.73,3.31],[3.37,3.46],[3.55,3.89],[3.95,4.04],[4.12,4.92]]},{"text":"Later, metal coins were created to make trade easier.","words":[[0,0.55],[0.63,0.94],[1.01,1.39],[1.44,1.61],[1.67,2.1],[2.15,2.22],[2.3,2.53],[2.59,2.96],[3.03,3.9]]},{"text":"Coins had shapes and marks to show their value.","words":[[0,0.48],[0.53,0.7],[0.77,1.17],[1.22,1.31],[1.41,1.78],[1.83,1.93],[2.01,2.24],[2.31,2.5],[2.57,3.39]]},{"text":"Carrying many heavy coins could be hard.","words":[[0,0.56],[0.66,0.93],[1,1.28],[1.36,1.76],[1.82,2.01],[2.03,2.14],[2.21,2.97]]},{"text":"So paper money was invented to replace heavy metal coins.","words":[[0,0.22],[0.31,0.64],[0.7,0.96],[1.03,1.2],[1.28,1.78],[1.82,1.89],[1.97,2.45],[2.51,2.79],[2.86,3.16],[3.24,4.09]]},{"text":"Banks were created to store money safely.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.45,0.63],[0.69,1.13],[1.15,1.22],[1.28,1.61],[1.68,1.95],[2.02,2.88]]},{"text":"Today, people can use cards and phones to pay digitally.","words":[[0,0.44],[0.49,0.82],[0.87,1.03],[1.11,1.3],[1.37,1.81],[1.86,1.97],[2.06,2.46],[2.52,2.61],[2.71,2.91],[3.01,4.04]]},{"text":"From barter to digital money, trade has changed over time.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.36,0.77],[0.82,0.92],[0.99,1.46],[1.54,2.03],[2.24,2.57],[2.61,2.75],[2.84,3.27],[3.33,3.53],[3.61,4.41]]}]}